  "remarks": "JSC Research Institute of Precision Instruments NII TP is an organisation conducting activities in the space and military sphere and supplies the Russian Ministry of Defence and also the Ministry of Emergency Situations with special equipment and services. The company is part of the “Roscosmos” state corporation and participates as a key enterprise in various Russian space projects run by the “Roscosmos”. The company has been working on the new satellite system for the Russian army, the Kasatka-R synthetic space radar. At the Army Forum 2024 the company presented the Kasatka-R radar and the Compact-4 synthetic radar developed for capturing highly detailed images of terrain and objects. Furthermore in September 2025 the company’s monitoring flight equipment was used during the flight of the Bion-M No. 2 biosatellite into space.",
